<Section collapsed="false" isCollapsible="true" drawButton="true" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title><Text-field style="Heading 1" layout="Heading 1">WS5 -- Example 7: Laplace equation, descent algorithm (verification)</Text-field></Title>
<Section collapsed="false" isCollapsible="true" drawButton="true" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title><Text-field style="Heading 2" layout="Heading 2">Setup</Text-field></Title>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L2" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">restart;
# WS5: verification of Example 7, Section 8.5 (Laplace equation u_xx + u_yy = 0,
# rotation symmetry with characteristic phi = y u_x - x u_y, descent algorithm
# of Section 6 for the presymplectic structure omega_hat = theta^theta_x^dy - theta^theta_y^dx).
# Independent variables [x, y]: u1[1,1] = u_xx, theta = Cu1[], theta_x = Cu1[1], theta_y = Cu1[2].
# v1 = chi (symbolic characteristic), w1 = G (symbolic element of P(n, m)).
# All CHECKs must print 0 (3 checkpoints).
with(DifferentialGeometry): with(JetCalculus):
K := 6:
DGsetup([x, y], [u1, v1, w1], J, K):
Vol := evalDG(Dx &amp;wedge Dy):
F_form1 := u1[1,1] + u1[2,2];              # Laplace
phi_chi := y*TotalDiff(v1[], [1]) - x*TotalDiff(v1[], [2]):   # l_phi(chi)
lF_chi  := TotalDiff(v1[], [1,1]) + TotalDiff(v1[], [2,2]):   # l_F(chi)</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SShGX2Zvcm0xR0YoLCYmSSN1MUdGKDYkIiIiRjJGMiZGMDYkIiIjRjVGMjcjRi4=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
</Section>
<Section collapsed="false" isCollapsible="true" drawButton="true" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title><Text-field style="Heading 2" layout="Heading 2">Step 1: the operator nu</Text-field></Title>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L3" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal"># Step 1 of Example 7, eq. (6.2): with Phi = y D_x - x D_y and psi(G) = theta^G dx^dy,
#   psi(Phi(G)) = d_0(nu(G)) + G (x theta_y - y theta_x)^dx^dy,   nu(G) = -G theta^(x dx + y dy).
# Here d_0 = dx^i ^ L_{D_i} of Section 2 coincides with HorizontalExteriorDerivative
# (Cartan forms written to the left of dx, dy), so sgn = 1.
# CHECK 1 (expect 0).
sgn := 1:
LHS := evalDG( (y*w1[1] - x*w1[2]) * Cu1[] &amp;wedge Vol ):
nuG := evalDG( -w1[]*x * Cu1[] &amp;wedge Dx - w1[]*y * Cu1[] &amp;wedge Dy ):
evalDG( LHS - sgn*HorizontalExteriorDerivative(nuG)
   - w1[]*(x*Cu1[2] - y*Cu1[1]) &amp;wedge Vol );</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display=""></Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
</Section>
<Section collapsed="false" isCollapsible="true" drawButton="true" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title><Text-field style="Heading 2" layout="Heading 2">Step 2: the operator nu o l_F - gamma_omega o l_phi</Text-field></Title>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L4" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal"># Step 2 of Example 7: gamma_omega(chi) = E_chi _| omega_hat
#   = chi theta_x dy - chi_x theta dy - chi theta_y dx + chi_y theta dx,
# and l_phi(chi) = y chi_x - x chi_y, l_F(chi) = chi_xx + chi_yy.
gamma_om := c -&gt; evalDG(  c * Cu1[1] &amp;wedge Dy - TotalDiff(c,[1]) * Cu1[] &amp;wedge Dy
   - c * Cu1[2] &amp;wedge Dx + TotalDiff(c,[2]) * Cu1[] &amp;wedge Dx ):
OP := evalDG( -lF_chi*x*Cu1[] &amp;wedge Dx - lF_chi*y*Cu1[] &amp;wedge Dy
   - gamma_om(phi_chi) ):</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L5" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal"># CHECK 2 (expect 0): OP equals the displayed expression of Example 7 (order 2 = r + n - 1).
Displayed := evalDG(
   - (y*v1[1,2] + x*v1[1,1] + v1[1]) * Cu1[] &amp;wedge Dx
   - (y*v1[2,2] + x*v1[1,2] + v1[2]) * Cu1[] &amp;wedge Dy
   + (y*v1[1] - x*v1[2]) * (Cu1[2] &amp;wedge Dx - Cu1[1] &amp;wedge Dy) ):
evalDG( OP - Displayed );</Text-field>
</Input>
